### Topic 50 - OAuth2 Resource Server with a local Keycloak
### 1) docker compose up -d   (topic folder)   2) cd resource-server; mvn spring-boot:run
### VS Code "REST Client" extension.
###
### NOTE: the "password" grant below is ONLY for learning/testing with curl.
### It is deprecated in OAuth 2.1 - real apps use the Authorization Code flow (+ PKCE).

@keycloak = http://localhost:8180/realms/course
@api = http://localhost:8081

### 0. OIDC discovery document - every URL of the Authorization Server in one JSON
GET {{keycloak}}/.well-known/openid-configuration

### 1. Get a token for alice (role user)
# @name alice
POST {{keycloak}}/protocol/openid-connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=password&client_id=course-client&client_secret=course-secret&username=alice&password=alice123&scope=openid%20profile%20email

### 2. Public endpoint -> 200 (no token)
GET {{api}}/api/public/courses

### 3. /api/me without token -> 401
GET {{api}}/api/me

### 4. /api/me with alice's token -> 200 (shows claims + authorities)
GET {{api}}/api/me
Authorization: Bearer {{alice.response.body.access_token}}

### 5. /api/profile needs SCOPE_profile -> 200
GET {{api}}/api/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{alice.response.body.access_token}}

### 6. /api/admin/report as alice -> 403
GET {{api}}/api/admin/report
Authorization: Bearer {{alice.response.body.access_token}}

### 7. Get a token for boss (roles user + admin)
# @name boss
POST {{keycloak}}/protocol/openid-connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=password&client_id=course-client&client_secret=course-secret&username=boss&password=boss123&scope=openid%20profile%20email

### 8. /api/admin/report as boss -> 200
GET {{api}}/api/admin/report
Authorization: Bearer {{boss.response.body.access_token}}

### 9. Refresh: trade the refresh token for a NEW access token (no password needed)
POST {{keycloak}}/protocol/openid-connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=refresh_token&client_id=course-client&client_secret=course-secret&refresh_token={{alice.response.body.refresh_token}}
